    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onoŋo Akab tye ki awobene pyerabiro ma gibedo i Camaria. Yeko ocako coyo waraga mogo, ci ocwalogi i Camaria bot ludito ma giloyo gaŋ meno, ki bot ludoŋo, ki bot lugwok litino awobe pa Akab, kun waco ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Litino pa rwotwu tye botwu, dok bene wutye ki gadigadi lweny ki aguragura-gu, ki gaŋi ma girumo ki cel gogo, ki jami lweny-gu. Doŋ ka ce waraga man oo botwu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wuyer latin ker mo maber ki ma romo loc ki i kin litino awobe pa rwotwu, ci wuket i wi komker pa wonne, ka doŋ wulweny pi ot pa rwotwu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento gubedo ki lworo matek, ci guwacci, “Nen ba, ka luker aryo ca pe gucuŋ i nyime, ci wan kono watwero cuŋ i nyime niŋniŋ?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pienno dano ma onoŋo loyo kal ki ŋat ma loyo gaŋ ducu, kacel ki ludoŋo ki lugwok litino, gucwalo lok bot Yeko kun giwacci, “Wan luticci; wabitiyo gin ducu ma ibicikowa kwede. Wan pe wabiketo kabaka mo; in iti gin ma ineno ni ber.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok onwoyo coyo botgi waraga me aryo, kun waco ni, “Ka ce wun wutye tuŋ bota, ka ce wuyubbe me woro doga, ci wukwany wi litino awobe pa rwotwu, ci wubin bota i Jejreel diki ka onyoo.” Onoŋo litino awobe pa kabaka ma romo jo pyerabiro gitye bot jo madito ma i gaŋ meno ma gibedo ka pitogi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka waraga oo botgi, ci gumako litino awobe pa kabaka, gunekogi woko, jo pyerabiro-nu, gucoko wigi i aduku mogo, gutero wa i Jejreel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka lakwena ocito otitte ni, “Doŋ gityeko kelo wi litino awobe pa kabaka ducu,” ci en ogamo ni, “Wucan wigi obed odu aryo ki i ŋet dogcel me gaŋ, ka ma gidonyo iye, obed nio wa odiko.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka okato odiko, ocuŋ iye ci owaco bot lwak ducu ni, “Wun pe wutye ki bal mo. An gira apiro lok me neko rwoda, ci atyeko neko en woko; ento aŋa ma oneko jo magi woko ducu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ber wune atir ni lok pa Rwot pe poto piny noŋo. Lok ma yam Rwot oloko ma dok i kom ot pa Akab bicobbe ducu; pien Rwot otyeko tiyo gin ma yam owaco ki i dog Laticce Elia.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HOS.1.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Koc 1.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeko dok oneko jo ducu ma i ot pa Akab mudoŋŋe i Jejreel, oneko wa jone madito-gu ducu, ki lureme ma cok kwede, ki ajwagine, nio ka otyekogi woko ducu ma acel mo pe odoŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka otiŋo wot ocito wa i Camaria. Ki i yo ma onoŋo en tye i Bet-eked ka ma lukwat gigurre iye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeko oromo ki jo ma gin ludoggola pa Akajia kabaka me Juda, openyo ni, “Wun aŋa-gi?” Gugamo ni, “Wan ludoggola pa Akajia, wan wabino ka moto litino kal ki litino awobe pa daker yo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "En owacci, “Wumakgi makwo.” Ci gumakogi makwo, gunekogi woko ka ŋet bur me Bet-eked, jo ma giromo pyeraŋwen wiye aryo, ne oweko acel mo obwot.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka oa woko ki kunnu, ci orwatte ki Yekonadab wod pa Rekab ma bino ka jolo wiye; ci omoto en, owacce ni, “Cwinyi leŋ i koma macalo an cwinya leŋ kwede i komi-ni?” Yekonadab odok iye ni, “At ye kit meno.” Yeko owacci, “Ka it ye kit meno, ci cwal ciŋi bota.” En ocako cwalo ciŋe. Yeko otiŋe i gadigadine, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kun wacce ni, “Bin wacit kacel, wek inen kit ma akemo maka kwede pi Rwot.” Kit meno Yeko ocako tere i gadigadine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka oo i Camaria, ci oneko jo pa Akab ducu ma onoŋo gudoŋ kunnu, nio ka oyweyogi woko ducu liweŋ, kit ma yam Rwot oloko ki Elia-ni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeko dok ocoko lwak ducu, owaco botgi ni, “Akab yam otiyo ki Baal manok mo, ento abitiyo bote makato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pienno wulwonna lunebi pa Baal ducu, ki jo ma giworo en ducu, ki ajwagine ducu; pe ŋatti mo obed peke, pien atye ki gitum madwoŋ me atyera bot Baal; dano mo ma obedo pe, pe bibedo makwo.” Ento Yeko otiyo ki ryeko laum wan: pien onoŋo oyubbe me tyeko luwor Baal woko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeko dok ociko ni, “Wulwon cokke madit pi Baa!.” Ci gucako lwoŋone. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeko ocwalo kwena oromo i Icrael ducu, ci luwor Baal ducu gubino; pe dano mo odoŋ ma pe obino. Gucako donyo i ot pa Baal, ci ot pa Baal opoŋ tuŋŋi ki tuŋŋi ducu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeko owaco bot ladit me ot boŋŋi ni, “Kel ginaruka pi luwor Baal ducu.” En ocako kelo ginaruka pigi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeko ocako cito i ot pa Baal kacel ki Yekonadab wod pa Rekab; ci owaco bot luwor Baal ni, “Wuyeny, wek wunen ni lutic pa Rwot mo pe odoŋ i kinwu, kono luwor Baal keken.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "En dok odonyo iye ka tyero gityer ki gitum awaŋa-gu. Yeko onoŋo doŋ okano jo pyeraboro woko i ŋe ot, kun wacci, “Dano mo ma oye ŋat mo acel ki i kom jo ma amiyo i ciŋwu-ni obwot, ci kwone aye bidyero ka waŋe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka otyeko tyero gitum awaŋa, Yeko owaco bot lukur-piny ki ludito pa askari ducu ni, “Wudony i ot, wunekgi woko; pe wuwek dano mo obwoti.” Kit meno gunekogi woko ki pala lucwan, ci lukur-piny ki ludito pe askari ducu gucako bologi woko, ka gudonyo kwede wa i kicika ma i tyelo ot pa Baal, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ci gukelo wir ma nene tye i ot pa Baal woko, guwaŋo woko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok gumuko wir pa Baal woko, ka dok gumuko ot pa Baal bene, guloko odoko ot coron nio wa onyoo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
