          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeko pe obwoto lubo bal pa Jeroboam wod pa Nebat ma omiyo jo Icrael bene gubalo-ni, en aye bal me woro litino twoni me jabu ma i Betel ki Dan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwot owaco bot Yeko ni, “Pien in itimo ber pi tiyo gin ma nen atir i waŋa, dok ityeko timo ot pa Akab kit ducu ma tye i cwinya-ni, pienno likwayi gibibedo i wi komker me Icrael nio i yalwak me aŋwenne.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento Yeko yam pe ogwokke ka lubo cik pa Rwot Lubaŋa pa Icrael ki cwinye ducu; pe obwoto lubo bal pa Jeroboam, ma en omiyo jo Icrael bene gubalo-ni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
